## 3. High-End Zero-Trust Security System

| Security Layer | Implementation Mechanism | Protection Guarantee |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **HTTP Security Armor** | Strict Helmet-compliant headers (`Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; preload`, `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`, `X-Frame-Options: DENY`, `Permissions-Policy`) | Prevents MIME-sniffing, clickjacking, protocol downgrade attacks, and unauthorized iframe embedding. |
| **Content Security Policy (CSP)** | Whitelisted script, style, font, and media sources (`self`, Google Fonts, Google Analytics, Pexels media). | Eliminates arbitrary cross-site scripting (XSS) and rogue script injection. |
| **Multi-Tier Rate Limiting** | Sliding-window in-memory tracking with automatic memory garbage collection. | **Global:** Max 600 req/15min.<br>**Lead Forms:** Max 10 inquiries/15min.<br>**Admin Auth:** Max 5 tries/15min.<br>**AI Copilot:** Max 25 queries/10min. |
| **Honeypot Anti-Bot Trap** | Hidden input fields in inquiry payloads. Automated scrapers and spam bots fill these fields automatically. | Silently rejects bot submissions with `200 OK` without wasting processing power or cluttering the CRM. |
| **Input Sanitization** | Recursive tag and character stripping (`<[^>]*>?`). | Neutralizes SQL injection (SQLi), NoSQL injection, and stored HTML payloads before touching data layers. |
| **Cryptographic Admin Auth** | SHA-256 with custom salt and `crypto.timingSafeEqual` comparison, plus stateless HS256 JSON Web Tokens. | Immune to GPU rainbow table cracking and timing side-channel attacks. |
| **Server-Side AI Protection** | Gemini 3.8 Flash copilot proxy. | Client never sees or handles `GEMINI_API_KEY`. Server rate-limits usage and falls back to an offline regulatory knowledge engine if external API quotas are reached. |

